Package: HFInYoungWomen
Title: Unsupervised Learning for Heart Failure Phenotyping in Young Women
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given="Joshua",family="Khorsandi", email="jkhorsa1@jh.edu", role=c("aut", "cre"))
Description: OHDSI study package for unsupervised clustering of features to
    identify heart failure phenotypes in women under 55 years old. Creates the
    cohort, extracts features, trains a Variational Deep Embedding (VaDE)
    model and assigns every cohort patient to a cluster, end to end from
    connection details in an env file.
